# WhyWalk Caravans -- animated silt strider travel
#
# A WhyWalk module: load it AFTER "00 Core". Its settings sit on Core's
# WhyWalk page, and Core's ridingAnim.lua already resolves a sitting pose for
# the SILT_STRIDER mount type, so the rider animation needs no change here --
# which is what SILTSTRIDER_NOTES.md's IMPLEMENTATION NOTE predicted.
#
# REQUIRES UI Toolkit (https://www.nexusmods.com/morrowind/mods/60303) for the
# destination menu. Without it the module stands down and vanilla travel is
# untouched; it is an optional dependency, not a hard one.

GLOBAL: scripts/WhyWalk/Caravans/caravans_global.lua
PLAYER: scripts/WhyWalk/Caravans/caravans_player.lua
CUSTOM: scripts/WhyWalk/Caravans/caravans_vehicle.lua
